# Build artifacts from `newm2 build projects/mf66ide/*.mod`.
# The compiled binary is written next to each source with NO file extension on
# macOS (e.g. mf66ide), which *.exe/*.obj can't catch — so ignore everything here
# except sources + scripts, and the macOS bare-name binaries go away too.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*.mod
!*.def
!*.md
!*.sh
